ket and trend analysis, see market shifts, and create reports - all without leaving the IJGlobal platform.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; line-height:150%\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:150%; text-align:center; font-weight:normal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Effortlessly <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">explore and compare potential investors,&nbsp;identify assets&nbsp;and&nbsp;build a pipeline of investment opportunities.</span></span></h2></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:15px 20px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17544739955352\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse:separate!important\">\n    <tbody><tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#559b43\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; border-radius:8px; cursor:auto; background-color:#559b43; mso-padding-alt:12px 18px\">\n        <a href=\"https://hub.ijglobal.com/request-demo?utm_medium=email%20marketing&amp;utm_source=pardot&amp;utm_campaign=ij_ijglobal+relaunch_2025-08-13_lead+gen&amp;utm_content=button&amp;utm_term=prospects_funds_general\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00a4bd; font-size:16px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; Margin:0; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0px; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 18px; display:block\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"nKbFdG7t\">\n          <strong style=\"colo